# ThetaForge Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "User Interface Layer"
        UI[React Dashboard]
        DISC[Discord/Telegram Alerts]
        SLACK[Slack Bot]
    end

    subgraph "Orchestrator Layer (FastAPI + Celery)"
        API[REST API]
        CELERY[Celery Workers]
        BEAT[Celery Beat Scheduler]
    end

    subgraph "Agent Layer"
        A1[1. Data Ingestion<br/>ib_insync]
        A2[2. Scanner<br/>Go Microservice]
        A3[3. Volatility Engine<br/>IV Rank/Percentile]
        A4[4. Strategy Filter<br/>Rule-Based]
        A5[5. Flow Analysis<br/>Unusual Activity]
        A6[6. Sentiment NLP<br/>10-Pass ROT]
        A7[7. LLM Reasoning<br/>Circuit Breaker]
        A8[8. Risk Management<br/>Kelly + Limits]
        A9[9. Execution<br/>Order Manager]
        A10[10. Performance<br/>Kinfo-Style]
        A11[11. Backtester]
        A12[12. Alerts/Notifier]
    end

    subgraph "Strategy Layer"
        S1[Wheel Strategy]
        S2[Vertical Spreads]
        S3[0DTE Gamma Blast]
        S4[Iron Condors]
        S5[Credit Spreads]
        S6[Covered Calls]
        S7[Earnings Straddles]
    end

    subgraph "Data Layer"
        PG[(TimescaleDB<br/>Tick/OHLC Data)]
        PGR[(PostgreSQL<br/>Trades/Accounts)]
        REDIS[(Redis<br/>Cache/Streams)]
    end

    subgraph "External Integrations"
        IBKR[IBKR TWS/Gateway]
        YF[Yahoo Finance]
        AV[Alpha Vantage]
        POLY[Polygon.io]
        REDDIT[Reddit API]
        TWITTER[Twitter/X API]
    end

    UI --> API
    DISC --> A12
    SLACK --> A12
    
    API --> CELERY
    BEAT --> CELERY
    
    CELERY --> A1
    CELERY --> A2
    CELERY --> A4
    
    A1 --> IBKR
    A1 --> PG
    A2 --> REDIS
    A3 --> PG
    A5 --> REDIS
    A6 --> REDDIT
    A6 --> TWITTER
    
    A1 --> A2
    A2 --> A3
    A3 --> A4
    A4 --> A5
    A5 --> A6
    A6 --> A7
    A7 --> A8
    A8 --> A9
    A9 --> IBKR
    A9 --> A10
    A10 --> A12
    
    S1 --> A4
    S2 --> A4
    S3 --> A4
    S4 --> A4
    S5 --> A4
    S6 --> A4
    S7 --> A4
```

## Data Flow

1. **Data Ingestion** streams real-time market data from IBKR via `ib_insync`
2. **Scanner** (Go) concurrently scans 7000+ securities, publishing candidates to Redis
3. **Volatility Engine** calculates IV Rank, IV Percentile, and Greeks for each candidate
4. **Strategy Filter** applies strategy-specific rules and thresholds
5. **Flow Analysis** detects unusual options activity
6. **Sentiment NLP** analyzes Reddit/Twitter/news for market sentiment
7. **LLM Reasoning** synthesizes all inputs with circuit breaker protection
8. **Risk Management** validates against Kelly Criterion and portfolio limits
9. **Execution** places orders with stop-losses via IBKR
10. **Performance Tracker** records trades and calculates Sharpe/Win Rate/Drawdown
11. **Alerts** notify via Discord/Telegram/Slack

## Risk Circuit Breakers

| Circuit Breaker | Threshold | Action |
|----------------|-----------|--------|
| Daily Loss | -15% | Halt all trading |
| Max Drawdown | -50% | Permanent halt |
| LLM Failures | 3 consecutive | Shutdown LLM path |
| Net Delta | >20% | Reject new positions |
| Net Vega | >5% | Reject new positions |
| Position Risk | >2% per trade | Reject trade |

## Strategy Isolation

Each strategy runs on a **separate IBKR sub-account** to prevent cross-contamination, following ThetaGang's recommendation.
